      "content": "the problem is i already talked to them and they just gave me some scripted response about \"internal security protocols\" and \"standard automated monitoring.\" they won't actually look into it. it's like they're hiding behind these vague terms so they don't have to admit they're doing it on purpose. if they're trying to squeeze my accounts until I'm forced to close them, how do i even defend myself? i need to know what kind of moves i can make to protect my money from them before they finalize this.",
